#: src/quick-start/installation.md:3
msgid ""
"rut is a self-hosting-free, from-source toolchain: one Rust build gives you "
"the `rut` binary (run / format / pack / dump) plus the language's in-tree "
"packages, which the engine mounts automatically when you run a standalone "
"file."
msgstr "rut 是一套无需自举、从源码构建的工具链：一次 Rust 构建就给你 `rut` 二进制（run / format / pack / dump），外加这门语言随树内置的包——运行独立文件时，引擎会自动挂载它们。"

#: src/quick-start/installation.md:8
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: src/quick-start/installation.md:10
msgid ""
"**Rust (nightly)** — the repo pins an exact nightly in "
"`rust-toolchain.toml`; `rustup` installs it on the first build. Any recent "
"`rustup` works."
msgstr "**Rust（nightly）**——仓库在 `rust-toolchain.toml` 里锁定了一个确切的 nightly；首次构建时 `rustup` 会安装它。任何较新的 `rustup` 都行。"

#: src/quick-start/installation.md:13
msgid "**git** — for the checkout."
msgstr "**git**——用于检出仓库。"

#: src/quick-start/installation.md:15
msgid ""
"**Node.js 20+** — only if you want to build or drive the wasm playground "
"(the rest of the book does not need it)."
msgstr "**Node.js 20+**——仅当你要构建或驱动 wasm Playground 时才需要（本书的其余部分用不到它）。"

#: src/quick-start/installation.md:18
msgid "Build the toolchain"
msgstr "构建工具链"

