#: src/quick-start/installation.md:36
msgid ""
"The binary embeds the whole engine: lexer, parser, compiler, typed bytecode, "
"and the VM. It also carries the vendored packages from the repo's `rut/` "
"directory (`core`, `pouch`, `ink`, `json`, …) — a standalone `hello.rut` "
"that says `use ink::{ Logger };` just works, no manifest required."
msgstr "这个二进制内嵌了整个引擎：词法分析器、语法分析器、编译器、类型化字节码和 VM。它还携带仓库 `rut/` 目录里自带的包（`core`、`pouch`、`ink`、`json` 等）——一个写着 `use ink::{ Logger };` 的独立 `hello.rut` 直接就能跑，不需要任何清单。"

