#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:3
msgid ""
"rut feels like TypeScript on the surface and Rust underneath the hood. This "
"page walks one file through the whole toolchain — running, formatting, "
"inspecting, and budgeting — so every later page can assume the workflow."
msgstr "rut 表面感觉像 TypeScript，引擎盖之下是 Rust。本页带着一个文件走完整条工具链——运行、格式化、检视、预算控制——之后的每一页都可以默认这套工作流。"

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:8
msgid "Write and run"
msgstr "编写并运行"

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:10
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"hello\");\n"
"    let name = \"rut\";\n"
"    log.info(f\"hello, {name}!\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"hello\");\n"
"    let name = \"rut\";\n"
"    log.info(f\"hello, {name}!\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:20
msgid "Save it as `hello.rut` and run it:"
msgstr "把它保存为 `hello.rut` 并运行："

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:30
msgid "Three things to notice:"
msgstr "三个值得注意的点："

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:32
msgid ""
"**One file is one module.** There is no include form; cross-module code is "
"reached through `use` paths (see the [modules "
"tutorial](../tutorial/modules.md))."
msgstr "**一个文件就是一个模块。**没有 include 形式；跨模块代码经由 `use` 路径到达（参见[模块教程](../tutorial/modules.md)）。"

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:35
msgid ""
"**`use ink::{ Logger };`** pulls `Logger` out of the `ink` package. When you "
"`rut run` a standalone file, the vendored packages mount automatically — no "
"manifest needed."
msgstr "**`use ink::{ Logger };`** 把 `Logger` 从 `ink` 包里取出来。当你 `rut run` 一个独立文件时，自带的包会自动挂载——不需要清单。"

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:38
msgid ""
"**`f\"hello, {name}!\"`** is a format literal: `{expr}` interpolates any "
"expression, rendered through the value's display contract."
msgstr "**`f\"hello, {name}!\"`** 是格式化字面量：`{expr}` 插值任意表达式，并经由该值的 display 契约渲染。"

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:41
msgid "`pub fn main()` is the entry the CLI calls."
msgstr "`pub fn main()` 是 CLI 调用的入口。"

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:43
msgid "Values, briefly"
msgstr "值：速览"

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:45
msgid "Extend the file — rut infers, and every type is known at compile time:"
msgstr "扩展这个文件——rut 会推断，且每个类型在编译期都已知："

#: src/quick-start/first-program.md:47
msgid ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"hello\");\n"
"    let n = 10;            // i32 — the integer default\n"
"    let scale = 1.5;       // f32 — the float default\n"
"    let big: u64 = 10;     // u64 via annotation — fits the default\n"
"    let flags = [1, 2, 3]; // [i32] — a fixed heap cell\n"
"    let mut sum = 0;       // `mut` — this one is written to\n"
"    for (let x of flags) {\n"
"        sum += x * n;\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"sum={sum} scale={scale}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```rut\n"
"use ink::{ Logger };\n"
"\n"
"pub fn main() {\n"
"    let log = Logger.new(\"hello\");\n"
"    let n = 10;            // i32 — the integer default\n"
"    let scale = 1.5;       // f32 — the float default\n"
"    let big: u64 = 10;     // u64 via annotation — fits the default\n"
"    let flags = [1, 2, 3]; // [i32] — a fixed heap cell\n"
"    let mut sum = 0;       // `mut` — this one is written to\n"
"    for (let x of flags) {\n"
"        sum += x * n;\n"
"    }\n"
"    log.info(f\"sum={sum} scale={scale}\");\n"
"}\n"
"```"

