#: src/quick-start/playground.md:3
msgid ""
"The playground is the zero-install way to run rut: the whole engine — lexer, "
"parser, compiler, VM — compiled to WebAssembly and served as a static page. "
"It is deployed at **<https://playground.rut.hpp2334.com>**."
msgstr "Playground 是零安装运行 rut 的方式：整个引擎——词法分析器、语法分析器、编译器、VM——被编译成 WebAssembly，作为一个静态页面提供服务。它部署在 **<https://playground.rut.hpp2334.com>**。"

#: src/quick-start/playground.md:8
msgid "The layout"
msgstr "页面布局"

#: src/quick-start/playground.md:10
msgid ""
"**Case list** — prepared programs, ordered the way the repo's own gate runs "
"them: algorithms first (sieve, quicksort, matrix multiply), then "
"language-surface tours (classes, closures & generics, structs, literals, "
"checked arithmetic, str views, bytes, opaque, when, maps & sets, type "
"aliases), then memory shapes (node cycle, tree, weak cache)."
msgstr "**用例列表**——预先准备好的程序，排列顺序与仓库自家门禁运行它们的顺序一致：先是算法（筛法、快速排序、矩阵乘法），再是语言表面的巡礼（类、闭包与泛型、结构体、字面量、checked 算术、str 视图、bytes、opaque、when、映射与集合、类型别名），最后是内存形态（节点循环引用、树、弱引用缓存）。"

#: src/quick-start/playground.md:16
msgid ""
"**Editor** — the case's source, live-editable. The cases are read from the "
"same `.rut` files the repository's native test gate compiles and runs, so "
"what you edit is the real corpus, not a copy."
msgstr "**编辑器**——用例的源码，可实时编辑。用例读取自仓库原生测试门禁编译运行的同一批 `.rut` 文件，因此你编辑的是真实语料，不是副本。"

#: src/quick-start/playground.md:19
msgid ""
"**Output / AST / IR panes** — every run shows the program's real output plus "
"the two compile views: the parsed AST and the typed IR the compiler lowers "
"to. `rut dump <file>` prints the same structures from the CLI."
msgstr "**输出 / AST / IR 面板**——每次运行都显示程序的真实输出，外加两个编译视图：解析出的 AST 和编译器最终下降到的类型化 IR。`rut dump <file>` 从 CLI 打印同样的结构。"

#: src/quick-start/playground.md:23
msgid ""
"**Budget control** — each run executes under an explicit fuel + heap budget "
"(default 10,000,000 fuel / 4 MiB heap). A budget that bites is a feature, "
"not a bug: one prepared case parks on the out-of-fuel trap on purpose, and "
"the Resume control adds fuel and continues the _same_ frame — that is "
"structured-concurrency-grade resumption, not a restart."
msgstr "**预算控制**——每次运行都在一个明确的燃料 + 堆预算下执行（默认 10,000,000 燃料 / 4 MiB 堆）。预算真正咬人是特性，不是缺陷：一个预备用例故意停在燃料耗尽的陷阱上，而 Resume 控件会追加燃料并继续_同一个_帧——这是结构化并发级别的恢复，不是重启。"

#: src/quick-start/playground.md:30
msgid "No silent fallback"
msgstr "无静默回退"

#: src/quick-start/playground.md:32
msgid ""
"The page probes the wasm artifact at boot. If the engine or the "
"syntax-highlighting module is missing or invalid, you get a full-page error "
"naming the exact build command — the panes never mount in a degraded mode. "
"On the deployed site this never happens; when you run a local build (below), "
"the preflight exists so a stale artifact cannot masquerade as a working "
"playground."
msgstr "页面在启动时会探测 wasm 产物。如果引擎或语法高亮模块缺失或无效，你会看到一个整页错误，写明确切的构建命令——各面板绝不会以降级模式挂载。在部署的站点上这永远不会发生；当你运行本地构建（见下）时，这道预检是为了让陈旧的产物无法冒充可用的 Playground。"

