"**Bugs** — broken contracts — trap loudly and immediately (`panic`, "
"`assert`, a nil deref, an out-of-bounds index)."
msgstr "**缺陷**——被破坏的契约——会响亮且立即地触发陷阱（`panic`、`assert`、对 nil 的解引用、越界索引）。"

#: src/tutorial/errors.md:12
