msgstr "`pub` 把名字发布给其他 _rut_ 模块。`entry` 把函数发布给_嵌入宿主_，其签名在编译期按边界的穿越规则检查："

#: src/tutorial/modules.md:228
msgid ""
"An embedded application drives these entries; `pub fn main` is the "
"conventional entry the `rut run` CLI calls. See [the host "
"boundary](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)."
msgstr "嵌入式应用驱动这些入口；`pub fn main` 是 `rut run` CLI 调用的惯例入口。参见[宿主边界](../core-concepts/host-boundary.md)。"

#: src/tutorial/modules.md:232
