#: src/tutorial/stdlib.md:105
msgid "Erasure and cleanup"
msgstr "擦除与清理"

#: src/tutorial/stdlib.md:107
msgid ""
"`opaque(v)` seals any value for recovery with `opaque.downcast<T>(o) -> ?T` "
"— see [errors and optionality](errors.md). `on_drop(p, cleanup)` runs a "
"callback when a cell's refcount reaches zero, and `Weak(v)` holds a "
"non-keeping reference (`upgrade() -> ?T`, `nil` once the referent died) — "
"the memory stories live in [the Rc heap and "
"destructors](../reference/rc-heap.md) and [weak "
"references](../reference/weak-refs.md)."
msgstr "`opaque(v)` 封存任意值，供日后以 `opaque.downcast<T>(o) -> ?T` 取回——参见[错误与可空性](errors.md)。`on_drop(p, cleanup)` 在单元的引用计数归零时运行一个回调，`Weak(v)` 持有一个不保活的引用（`upgrade() -> ?T`，所指者死亡后为 `nil`）——内存的故事见 [Rc 堆与析构器](../reference/rc-heap.md)与[弱引用](../reference/weak-refs.md)。"

#: src/tutorial/stdlib.md:116
msgid "`StrBuf` — the raw growable builder"
msgstr "`StrBuf`——原始的可增长构建器"

