msgstr "**JSON**——解码为 `opaque` 树、编码回去、往返一致，数字按原样词素存储，往返因此分毫不差"

#: src/examples/02-digest.md:16
msgid ""
"Nothing in the rut file trusts itself: the Rust host cross-checks every "
"algorithm against independent crates (the RustCrypto hash family, `base64`, "
"`crc32fast`, `serde_json`) on canonical test vectors _and_ on deterministic "
"pseudo-random inputs at every padding-edge length, plus a 64 KiB stress "
"blob. `digest.rut` knows nothing about the crates; only the host compares."
msgstr "rut 文件里没有任何东西信任自己：Rust 宿主把每个算法与独立的 crate（RustCrypto 哈希家族、`base64`、`crc32fast`、`serde_json`）交叉验证，既对规范测试向量，也对每一个填充边缘长度上的确定性伪随机输入，外加一个 64 KiB 的压力数据块。`digest.rut` 对那些 crate 一无所知；做比较的只有宿主。"

#: src/examples/02-digest.md:27
msgid "# the oracle, asserted\n"
msgstr "# 被 assert 的 oracle\n"

#: src/examples/02-digest.md:30
msgid "The run prints one verified row per check — abridged:"
msgstr "运行对每项检查打印一行已验证的结果——节选："

#: src/examples/02-digest.md:32
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"hex([114, 117, 116, 33]) = 72757421\n"
"b64([102, 111, 111, 98, 97, 114], url=false) = Zm9vYmFy  OK\n"
"digests, rut vs crates:\n"
"  md5     empty         fuel    8419  d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e  OK\n"
"  sha256  \"abc\"         fuel   18866  ba7816bf...f20015ad  OK\n"
"  md5     1 KiB lcg(42) fuel  113117  d6c1961991b0106647e36ca4ba12d345  OK\n"
"sample_doc -> "
"{\"name\":\"rut\",\"version\":0.2,\"tags\":[\"tiny\",\"fast\",\"verified\"],...}\n"
"serde_json parses it: OK\n"
"hash keys over that JSON text:\n"
"  crc32   eccc5960  OK\n"
"  fnv1a64 8ba697141da02e83  OK\n"
"hex_dec(\"zz\")   = \"hex: invalid character at index 0\"\n"
"json_dec(\"{,}\") = \"json: expected a key string at index 1\"\n"
"digest(\"md4\")   = \"unknown algorithm: md4\"\n"
"every row agrees: OK\n"
"fuel used: 1014105 of Some(50000000)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"hex([114, 117, 116, 33]) = 72757421\n"
"b64([102, 111, 111, 98, 97, 114], url=false) = Zm9vYmFy  OK\n"
"digests, rut vs crates:\n"
"  md5     empty         fuel    8419  d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e  OK\n"
"  sha256  \"abc\"         fuel   18866  ba7816bf...f20015ad  OK\n"
"  md5     1 KiB lcg(42) fuel  113117  d6c1961991b0106647e36ca4ba12d345  OK\n"
