#: src/examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md:196
msgid ""
"The HTTP bodies bind through `install_std_http` (the reqwest lane); the "
"example's own rows are CLI I/O only — `out` (stdout; `print` is a removed "
"core name), `eprint`, the file pair, and `exit` — declared in the "
"example-local `rgh_host` decl package and verified against the bindings at "
"boot ([Host fns and declaration files](../reference/host-fns.md)). One "
"consequence: `rut run` cannot host rgh itself — its rows are example-local — "
"but ordinary HTTP programs do run under `rut run`, which mounts the std http "
"pair by presence."
msgstr "HTTP 函数体经 `install_std_http` 绑定（reqwest 链路）；示例自己的行只有 CLI IO——`out`（stdout；`print` 是被移除的 core 名字）、`eprint`、文件对，以及 `exit`——声明在示例本地的 `rgh_host` 声明包里，并在启动时对照绑定校验（[宿主 fn 与声明文件](../reference/host-fns.md)）。一个后果：`rut run` 无法承载 rgh 本身——它的行是示例本地的——但普通的 HTTP 程序确实能在 `rut run` 下运行，后者按存在性挂载 std http 二件套。"

#: src/examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md:208
msgid ""
"**An async rut program in production shape**: the brain awaits at the fetch "
"sites only; the embedder launches, pumps to idle, and exits with the brain's "
"code."
msgstr "**一个生产形态的异步 rut 程序**：大脑只在取数站点 await；嵌入方启动、泵送到空闲，然后带着大脑的退出码退出。"

#: src/examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md:211
msgid ""
"**Headers-first send + one-shot body/stream** is the whole mental model of "
"the std http lane — drain JSON in one await, stream files chunk by chunk."
msgstr "**头部优先的发送 + 一次性 body/流**就是 std http 链路的全部心智模型：一次 await 排空 JSON，逐块流式下载文件。"

#: src/examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md:214
msgid ""
"**Failures are values end to end**: transport errors, 404s, wire deaths, and "
"io errors all become messages plus exit codes."
msgstr "**失败从头到尾都是值**：传输错误、404、线路死亡和 io 错误全部变成消息加退出码。"

#: src/examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md:216
msgid ""
"**The fixture lane is the test gate**: recorded replies keyed on method + "
"URL, deterministic chunks on a virtual clock, zero network."
msgstr "**夹具链路就是测试门禁**：按方法 + URL 为键的录制回应、虚拟时钟上确定性的数据块、零网络。"

#: src/examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md:219
msgid ""
"The peer gate is load-bearing here: mounting the collections is what makes "
"json's `Vec<T>` serde impls compile into this unit."
msgstr "对等门禁在这里是承重墙：挂载集合包，正是让 json 的 `Vec<T>` serde impl 编译进本单元的原因。"

#: src/examples/06-github-viewer-cli.md:222
msgid ""
"The lane's declarations live in the std tree; for the runner behind `rut "
"run`, see [the rut CLI](../reference/cli.md)."
msgstr "这条链路的声明住在 std 树里；`rut run` 背后的运行器，见[rut CLI](../reference/cli.md)。"

#: src/examples/playground-corpus.md:3
msgid ""
"The classics: seventeen short, self-contained rut programs in "
"`demo/src/examples/` that the web playground offers in its picker and runs "
"in your browser. They are not copies — the playground imports the `.rut` "
"files **raw**, so what you edit there is what this repo ships. The classics "
"are the fastest way to see the language surface in working code: algorithms "
"first, then the language-surface tours, then the memory shapes. The same "
"order is the playground's."
msgstr "经典案例：十七个短小自包含的 rut 程序，位于 `demo/src/examples/`，web Playground 在选择器里提供它们，并在你的浏览器里运行。它们不是复制品——Playground **原样**导入这些 `.rut` 文件，所以你在那里编辑的就是本仓库交付的东西。经典案例是看语言表面在可运行代码中亮相的最快途径：先是算法，然后是语言表面巡礼，最后是内存形态。这个顺序也是 Playground 的顺序。"

