"Coercions: **`T → ?T` boxes** (the box _aliases_ the payload's cell — a "
"share; primitives copy bits), **`?T → T` derefs** (a field-0 read plus nil "
"check). Both are implicit at the expected-type position; the funnel is "
"transitive through `??T`."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:68
#: src/reference/by-reference-and-nullable.md:78
msgid ""
"Auto-deref covers every value position: `p.x`, `p.m(..)`, `p[i]`, `for (x of "
"p)`, arithmetic on `p`'s payload."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:70
msgid ""
"`p == nil` / `p != nil` compare against the null slot; `?T == ?T` is slot "
"identity (see [Rc, dispose, and identity](rc-dispose-identity.md))."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:72
msgid ""
"A `?T` binding IS the cell reference — writes through it hit the shared cell "
"(gated by `mut`, see [Modules and visibility](modules-and-visibility.md))."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:75
msgid ""
"`on_drop<T>(p: ?T, cleanup: fn(?T))` attaches a cleanup that runs when the "
"cell's refcount reaches zero — one callback per nullable, a second attach is "
"a compile error."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:78
msgid ""
"Across the host boundary `?T` crosses nil-flattened when its element crosses."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:81
msgid ""
"The removed pointer spellings diagnose: `*T` and postfix `T?` point at `?T`; "
"expression `*x`/`&x` point at the sharing law (\"pass `x` directly\"). See "
"[By-reference and nullable](by-reference-and-nullable.md)."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:85
msgid "`Vec<T>` — the growable sequence"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:87
msgid ""
"`Vec<T>` is a library class (package `pouch`) over the non-growable `[T]`: a "
"`buf: [?T]` backing plus a live `len`. Loads yield the `?T` (uses "
"auto-deref), stores take the coerced handle — reads and writes alias the "
"stored cells, and binding an element copies nothing."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:92
msgid "Construction"
msgstr ""

