msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:97
msgid "copy a `[T]`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:99
msgid ""
"Explicit type arguments may be spelled at the call: `Vec<i32>.from([1, 2, "
"3])`. There is no `Vec<T>(..)` type-call — construction is always a method "
"call (see [Classes and constructors](classes.md))."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:106
msgid "`push(v)`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/builtin-generic-types.md:106
