"Workers are **separate VMs on separate threads** with separate heaps. There "
"is no shared memory: everything that crosses is a value on a typed channel, "
"moved or deep-copied under the rules below. Pure rut code inside one VM is "
"always single-threaded, which is what keeps the RC heap lock-free ([the Rc "
"heap](rc-heap.md))."
