#: src/reference/host-fns.md:66
msgid ""
"**The crossing set** — `host fn` signatures are concrete over: nil, the "
"primitives, `str`, `bytes`, `opaque`, tuples/`?T` whose elements cross, and "
"`host struct` records whose fields all cross. Returns may additionally use "
"the answer optionals `?str` / `?bytes` / `?opaque`. Everything else (user "
"classes, `Vec<T>`, `[T]`, trait objects, closures) is a compile error on the "
"declaration ([value boundary](value-boundary.md))."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/host-fns.md:73
msgid ""
