"handle in a class of its own — the wrapper-class pattern ([native containers "
"API surface](native-containers.md)). Destructors still run "
"deterministically: when a box's rc hits 0, the payload's finalize hook runs, "
"then Rust `Drop` ([the Rc heap](rc-heap.md))."
