msgid "In-tree consumers"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/native-containers.md:133
msgid ""
"**the logger** — `rt`'s two host fns behind `ink`'s `Logger` wrapper class "
"([core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md))."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/native-containers.md:135
msgid ""
"**`nmapset`** — `HashMap`/`HashSet` over a native key table: every method is "
"one host call, keys are the closed typed set, values are sealed boxes, and "
"each key carries a stable host-side handle ([core and the swappable "
"packages](stdlib.md))."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/native-containers.md:139
msgid ""
"**`json`**'s peer-gated container impls ride the same packages from the rut "
"side ([core and the swappable packages](stdlib.md))."
msgstr ""

