#: src/reference/reflection.md:3
msgid ""
"Reflection is a **trait**, not a keyword privilege. `Reflectable` is the "
"mechanism protocol; compiler auto-implementations (dataclasses, enums) and "
"builtin-impl registry entries (enums, records, `Vec`, `[T]`) fill it for the "
"data world; classes opt in by hand with a **curated** view. Libraries layer "
"contracts on top and take trait-object-typed consumers or bounded producers. "
"Nothing in the language names a builtin; no strings are matched; nothing "
"changes under `--release` stripping. Userland serde is the proving "
"application."
msgstr ""

